{"server":"kr","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_03_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_03","title":"뜻밖의 여정","storyCode":"GT-3","avgTag":"작전 후","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"d80c938b85dc65e3708cc4821d544e1a8e8d3c089cb6ba46b2ca851e88eb236c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"쓰러트렸어!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"밥 아저씨, 괜찮……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"앗? 그 다리의 상처는……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"바운티 헌터","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"저쪽에 놓친 녀석들이 있다! 와그니스크단 녀석들일지도 몰라!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"나 혼자 어떻게든 할 수 있어. 우선은 적을 해치운다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"알았어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"바운티 헌터","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"응?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"바운티 헌터","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"이 꼬마……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"바운티 헌터","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"어, 어이, 뭐야, 그 표정은……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"바운티 헌터","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"오, 오지 마. 벌집이 되고 싶은 거냐!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"바운티 헌터","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"어?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"전부 해치워 버린 건가?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"응."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"놀랍군. 그 작은 몸으로… 의지가 강하구나."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"거기 앉아서 가만히 있어. 붕대를 감을 테니까."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"별일 아니다. 일으켜 주겠나."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"안돼."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"보이지?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"응."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"이 결정을 봐라! 너도 감염되고 싶은 거냐?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"감염자를 구제하는 것이, 우리 로도스 아일랜드의 일이니까."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"로도스 아일랜드……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"로도스 아일랜드라니……? 빅토리아가 아니야……?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"원래는 빅토리아의 기마 경찰이었는데, 지금은 로도스 아일랜드의 오퍼레이터야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"나한테서 떨어져, 아가씨. 나는 감염자다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"저는……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"클로어, 피는 보지 않는 게 좋아. 물러나 있어."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"좋아, 피가 멈췄어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"항상 감염자를 이렇게 돕고 있나?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"무섭지 않은 거냐……?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"내 동료 중에도 감염자는 많지만, 감염자인지 아닌지는 솔직히 봐도 잘 모르겠고, 누가 감염되었는지도 별로 생각해 본 적 없어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"흐음…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"뭐, 목욕할 때는 역시 알게 되지만."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"……훗."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"고맙다, 차별 없는 꼬마."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["그라니"]}]}
